Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt. We've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,always said Tesla is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,not an auto company.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It is actually the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,convergence of three of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the platforms I mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so robotics, energy storage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and AI. Each one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,of those technologies has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,its own S-curve, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,now they're feeding each
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,other, and we're seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that in robotaxis. Robotaxis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we believe, will account
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,for 90% of Tesla's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,valuation by the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,of the decade. We're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,in print at 2,600.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes nothing for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Optimus robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're beginning to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,understand how quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tesla is moving on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that front. Why? Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's the convergence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,of the same three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,technologies- Mm-hmm robotics, energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,storage, and AI.
